      "writtenOn": "2024-02-29T20:00:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I believe all HID code in this driver operates in interrupt context- per https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/v6.6/driver-api/usb/gadget.html, setup() is handled \"in_interrupt\", and all HID functions are accessed either through __acc_setup() (called within gadget setup()) or in a req-\u003ecomplete callback, which I believe is interrupt context as well.",
      "parentUuid": "449bde44_ff682b9e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 544,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 544,
        "endChar": 41
      },
