      "writtenOn": "2024-02-29T20:00:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately, we don\u0027t have an actual device here. We have the very odd implementation of acc_dev_ref, and I am concerned about modifying the existing reference counting logic due to how broken it is, and fear that making changes to the acc_dev_ref reference counting will cause unforeseen issues.\n\nI was working to completely refactor the structure of this driver and properly implement reference counting, but the time to complete that and properly test/debug any issues is not conducive to the product schedule at this time. I would rather proceed with the known (unchanged) behavior from previous android versions then potentially introduce new issues.",
      "parentUuid": "f184ee7a_8bf2606a",
